#: ../../operations/invoices.rst:30
msgid ""
"**Periods:** The total number of months in the period determined by your "
"start and end date filters. If no start and end dates are set, a three "
"month period will be shown. If a one-month period is selected, the name "
"of that month (ex. Aug 2020) is shown"
msgstr ""
"**Periods:** The total number of months in the period determined by your "
"start and end date filters. If no start and end dates are set, a three "
"month period será shown. If a one-month period is selected, the name of "
"that month (ex. Aug 2020) is shown"

#: ../../operations/invoices.rst:31
msgid ""
"**Total Invoices:** The total number of invoices captured by current "
"filters"
msgstr ""
"**Total Invoices:** The total number de invoices captured por actual "
"filters"

#: ../../operations/invoices.rst:32
msgid ""
"**MTD Cost:** The combined month-to-date cost for all invoices captured "
"by current filters"
msgstr ""
"**MTD Cost:** The combined del mes hasta la fecha cost for all invoices "
"captured by current filters"

#: ../../operations/invoices.rst:33
msgid ""
"**Total Cost:** The expected total month-end cost for all invoices "
"captured by current filters"
msgstr ""
"**Total Cost:** The expected total fin de mes cost for all invoices "
"captured by current filters"

#: ../../operations/invoices.rst:36
msgid "Creating Views"
msgstr "Creación de vistas"

#: ../../operations/invoices.rst:38
msgid ""
"Invoice list views are highly-customizable allowing for virtually "
"limitless combinations of output columns and filtering. A common set of "
"output columns is provided in a default view but users can add and remove"
" columns from a large list of data points and even save multiple views "
"for easy access to different data sets. Any of your stored views can be "
"set as the default to be displayed each time the invoices list page is "
"active."
msgstr ""
"Factura list views are highly-customizable allowing for virtually "
"limitless combinations of output columns and filtering. A common set of "
"output columns is provided in a default view but users can add and "
"remove columns from a large list of data points and even save multiple "
"views for easy access to different data sets. Any of your stored views "
"can be set as the default to be displayed each time the invoices página "
"de lista is active."

