"**Metered Storage Price:** Storage price (cost plus markup) determined "
"by |morpheus| usage and pricing data (when live pricing data is not "
"available, such as with an local cloud without \"Sync Costing\" enabled)"

#: ../../operations/invoices.rst:104
msgid ""
"**Metered Network Price:** Network price (cost plus markup) determined by"
" |morpheus| usage and pricing data (when live pricing data is not "
"available, such as with an on-prem cloud without \"Sync Costing\" "
"enabled)"
msgstr ""
"**Metered Network Price:** Red price (cost plus markup) determined by "
"|morpheus| usage and pricing data (when live pricing data is not "
"available, such as with an local cloud without \"Sync Costing\" enabled)"

#: ../../operations/invoices.rst:105
msgid ""
"**Metered Extra Price:** Additional price (cost plus markup) determined "
"by |morpheus| usage and pricing data (when live pricing data is not "
"available, such as with an on-prem cloud without \"Sync Costing\" "
"enabled)"
msgstr ""
"**Metered Extra Price:** Additional price (cost plus markup) determined "
"by |morpheus| usage and pricing data (when live pricing data is not "
"available, such as with an local cloud without \"Sync Costing\" enabled)"

#: ../../operations/invoices.rst:106
msgid ""
"**Metered MTD Price:** Month-to-date price (cost plus markup) determined "
"by |morpheus| usage and pricing data (when live pricing data is not "
"available, such as with an on-prem cloud without \"Sync Costing\" "
"enabled)"
msgstr ""
"**Metered MTD Price:** Del mes hasta la fecha price (cost plus markup) "
"determined by |morpheus| usage and pricing data (when live pricing data "
"is not available, such as with an local cloud without \"Sync Costing\" "
"enabled)"

#: ../../operations/invoices.rst:107
msgid ""
"**Metered Total Price:** Total price (cost plus markup) determined by "
